  "language": "english",
  "text": "recently started using these. This is the LifeWave X39 patch. This is a non-transdermal patch that you place on your skin. You place this on your skin and you're using light therapy, phototherapy, along with acupuncture principles to reactivate dormant stem cells. Reactivating these dormant stem cells are going to help in wound healing, cellular function, and also anti-aging benefits. This is medical grade plastic. It stays even if you're in water or taking a shower or in the sauna but you peel it off on the back and you place it. It's suggested that you placed it at the base of your neck or right below your belly button. You're going to want to do 12 hours on and 12 hours off in a 24-hour period. They call these sleeves so each sleeve has 30 days worth of patches. I'm on this journey right now. I'd love to share more with you. I'm also a brand ambassador so if you would like to get the patches directly through me just go to the link in my bio and click on where it says LifeWave patches. This will take you to LifeWave's website but it will be under my personal store so I thank you and I appreciate you. If you have any questions also either drop them in the comments below, message me, or if you want to do this without having to talk to a human go to patchedu.com and there's tons of information there. All the best to you.",
